    [Feature][PD] Adapt Mooncake V2 Mamba transfers to PCP head sharding (#19518)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Adapt Mooncake Connector V2 to Mamba state sharding across PCP × TP
    workers, using TP-major/PCP-minor worker ranks for shard selection and
    reusing the existing Conv/SSM transfer slicing.
    
    Require PCP=1 or TP=1 until the backend supports joint PCP/TP sharding.
    Add coverage for worker-rank mapping and state transfer addresses across
    PCP/TP layouts.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    By CI.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a98247ab4db686ee03c66d5feb3c761e52a2f8ab
    
    Signed-off-by: nwpu-zxr <zhouxuerong2@huawei.com>

